00:54:05,016 --> 00:54:09,016
愚か者よ あの一矢放つ
you fools, I'll shoot that single arrow,

205
00:54:09,016 --> 00:54:14,016
容赦なく沈むのを
to ruthlessly sink you down.

206
00:54:14,516 --> 00:54:16,516
胸に刺さる
Piercing the chest,

207
00:54:16,516 --> 00:54:19,516
黒い魂の群れ
a crowd of black souls.

208
00:54:19,516 --> 00:54:21,516
影の底で
At the bottom of the shadows,

209
00:54:21,516 --> 00:54:24,516
忍び寄る奈落の渦
the creeping vortex of the abyss.

210
00:54:24,516 --> 00:54:26,516
まるで
Just like

211
00:54:26,516 --> 00:54:29,516
タロットが示すよう
what the Tarot cards foretell.

212
00:54:29,516 --> 00:54:31,516
手放したいなら
If you want to let go,

213
00:54:31,516 --> 00:54:33,516
諦めたいなら
if you want to give up,

214
00:54:33,516 --> 00:54:35,516
悪夢の中から
from this nightmare,

215
00:54:35,516 --> 00:54:38,516
逃げられるのなら
if you can escape...

216
00:54:38,516 --> 00:54:40,516
まだ掴んでる
You are still grasping onto it,

217
00:54:40,516 --> 00:54:44,016
欲が重いから
because your greed is too heavy.

218
00:54:44,016 --> 00:54:46,016
私だけのもの
It's mine,

219
00:54:46,016 --> 00:54:48,516
そう私だけのもの
yes, it belongs only to me.

220
00:54:48,516 --> 00:54:52,516
慎み深さを信じ込ませて縛って
Making me believe in modesty, binding me,

221
00:54:52,516 --> 00:54:55,516
縛り付けて
tying me down.

222
00:54:55,516 --> 00:54:57,516
だって気付いた
Because I realized...

223
00:54:57,516 --> 00:54:59,516
海の出口
the exit from the sea.

224
00:54:59,516 --> 00:55:01,373
永遠の揺らめきに
In the eternal shimmering...

225
00:55:01,373 --> 00:55:04,573
...連れ出す船よ
...The ship that carries me out,

226
00:55:04,873 --> 00:55:08,873
出航して
Set sail...

227
00:55:09,373 --> 00:55:12,573
私のもの また私のもの
Mine, once again, mine...

228
00:55:12,673 --> 00:55:15,673
積んで上ろう 打ち果てたとしても
I will pile them up and ascend, even if I am destroyed...

229
00:55:15,773 --> 00:55:20,873
枯れない魂までは
...until my undying soul.

230
00:55:20,973 --> 00:55:23,873
惑い 憂い 永遠の美貌
Confusion, grief, eternal beauty...

231
00:55:23,973 --> 00:55:27,873
そんな幻 そうだっていいでしょう
Such illusions... that is fine, is it not?

232
00:55:27,973 --> 00:55:31,873
手放して 翼ついたから
Since I let go and grew wings,

233
00:55:32,373 --> 00:55:38,373
最高 夜明けに舵向けて
it is wonderful. Steer towards the dawn!

234
00:55:42,373 --> 00:55:45,273
曰くを宿した船
The ship laden with pretexts,

235
00:55:45,373 --> 00:55:48,273
希望だけ残していく
leaves behind only hope.

236
00:55:48,373 --> 00:55:55,373
神は戻らないから
Since God will not return...

237
00:56:17,373 --> 00:56:20,373
風に吹かれて
Blown by the wind,

238
00:56:20,473 --> 00:56:23,473
誰も気づかぬよう
so that no one notices,

239
00:56:23,573 --> 00:56:26,373
区別がつかない保存
unable to tell them apart

240
00:56:26,373 --> 00:56:29,373
モノクロの世界保存
in this monochrome world.

241
00:56:29,473 --> 00:56:32,373
色を足しても
Even if I add colors,

242
00:56:32,473 --> 00:56:35,373
何も見えなくて
I can't see anything,

243
00:56:35,473 --> 00:56:38,373
まるで私は保存
as if I was...

244
00:56:38,473 --> 00:56:43,873
息を止めていた
...holding my breath.

245
00:56:45,873 --> 00:56:48,873
もういいよ 遠くても
It's okay now, even if it's far away,

246
00:56:48,973 --> 00:56:51,373
叶えたい 私は
I want to make it come true.

247
00:56:51,473 --> 00:56:53,873
この闇の世界保存
In this dark world,

248
00:56:53,973 --> 00:56:57,873
想いも抱きしめていたいのに
even though I want to hold my feelings close.

249
00:56:57,973 --> 00:57:01,173
夢のキャンバスに
On the canvas of dreams,

250
00:57:01,273 --> 00:57:04,373
描き続ける意味は
the meaning of continuing to paint

251
00:57:04,473 --> 00:57:09,873
この胸に 輝いている
is shining in this heart of mine,

252
00:57:09,973 --> 00:57:14,873
ストーリー
...as a story.

253
00:57:22,373 --> 00:57:25,873
怯えることに
Fearing things

254
00:57:25,973 --> 00:57:28,873
意味などないけれど
has no meaning, but...

255
00:57:28,973 --> 00:57:31,373
拾い集めた保存
...as I gather

256
00:57:31,473 --> 00:57:34,373
欠片 失うの保存
the pieces, I lose them.

257
00:57:34,473 --> 00:57:37,373
そして夜は保存
And the night...

258
00:57:37,473 --> 00:57:40,373
その冷たさを保存
...melts away

259
00:57:40,473 --> 00:57:44,373
溶かして手を伸ばした
its coldness as I reach out.

260
00:57:45,673 --> 00:57:48,773
もういいよ 遠くても
It's okay now, even if it's far away,

261
00:57:48,873 --> 00:57:51,173
届けたい 私は
I want to reach you.

262
00:57:51,273 --> 00:57:54,273
駆け抜けていく保存
I will run through,

263
00:57:54,373 --> 00:57:57,373
涙も抱きしめていたいのに
even though I want to hold my tears close.

264
00:57:57,473 --> 00:58:00,373
夢のキャンバスに
On the canvas of dreams,

265
00:58:00,473 --> 00:58:03,373
心 込めるのは
pouring my heart in

266
00:58:03,473 --> 00:58:06,273
この空に保存
is because I'll draw

267
00:58:06,373 --> 00:58:12,373
描き出していく ストーリー
a story onto this sky.

268
00:58:21,373 --> 00:58:24,373
そして夜は保存
And the night...

269
00:58:24,473 --> 00:58:27,373
その冷たさを保存
...melts away

270
00:58:27,473 --> 00:58:31,373
溶かして手を伸ばした
its coldness as I reach out.

271
00:58:31,373 --> 00:58:34,373
もういいの 遠くても
It's okay, even if it's far away,

272
00:58:34,473 --> 00:58:37,173
叶えたい 私の
I want to make it come true.

273
00:58:37,273 --> 00:58:40,273
超えぬ世界保存
My unpassable world...

274
00:58:40,373 --> 00:58:43,873
想いも言葉で包んだ
...I wrapped my feelings in words.

275
00:58:43,973 --> 00:58:46,873
夢のキャンバスに
On the canvas of dreams,

276
00:58:46,973 --> 00:58:50,373
色を足していく
I will add more color.

277
00:58:50,473 --> 00:58:53,273
この胸に保存
In this chest,

278
00:58:53,373 --> 00:58:55,873
今輝いて保存
shining right now.

279
00:58:55,973 --> 00:58:58,873
強くなくてもいい
It's okay not to be strong,

280
00:58:58,973 --> 00:59:01,873
壊れかけてもいい
it's okay to be broken.

281
00:59:01,973 --> 00:59:07,373
この心は大空に羽ばたいて
This heart will flap its wings into the sky,

282
00:59:07,473 --> 00:59:10,873
響くように
so that it resonates,

283
00:59:10,973 --> 00:59:15,373
塗り替えていく パレット
repainting the palette.

284
00:59:43,873 --> 00:59:46,373
Wow!

285
00:59:46,373 --> 00:59:50,373
Hello everyone!

286
00:59:50,373 --> 00:59:55,373
It is Day 2 of Connect the World!

287
00:59:58,373 --> 01:00:04,573
Yes, yes. Welcome to Day 2 of Takanashi Kiara and Ninomae Ina'nis's first concert, Connect the World.

288
01:00:04,896 --> 01:00:07,396
Are you guys enjoying the show so far?

289
01:00:10,296 --> 01:00:12,396
Yay!

290
01:00:12,396 --> 01:00:18,396
Ah... you know, um, I was really...
I want to talk about Taco-Tacover first because...

291
01:00:18,396 --> 01:00:24,296
...yesterday, I heard you guys
sing along to the instrumental.

292
01:00:24,296 --> 01:00:27,896
And I was like, "Uh, ah...

293
01:00:27,896 --> 01:00:32,996
...I feel bad for those on Day 1."
But, you know, I knew I was opening for, you know, Day 2,

294
01:00:32,996 --> 01:00:37,296
so I kind of thought of
a better song to open than Taco-Tacover, so...

295
01:00:37,296 --> 01:00:40,896
Hope you guys had fun singing it!
Thank you again!

296
01:00:43,096 --> 01:00:47,396
And of course,
I sang two of my senpais' songs.

297
01:00:47,396 --> 01:00:53,396
Um, Senchou's "Dead Man's Chest"
and Towa-senpai's "Palette".

298
01:00:53,396 --> 01:00:58,896
Um, I specifi-
I specifically wanted to...

299
01:00:58,896 --> 01:01:06,896
...choose, um, their songs because, um,
they're, you know, senpais that I really look up to.

300
01:01:06,896 --> 01:01:13,896
And, I always feel like, my journey here
wouldn't have been possible if I didn't discover my senpais...

301
01:01:13,896 --> 01:01:16,396
...many, many years ago.

302
01:01:16,396 --> 01:01:22,196
And I always, you know, wanted to pay respect
to the path they paved for us, so...

303
01:01:22,196 --> 01:01:25,896
Yeah, I hope you guys enjoyed it.

304
01:01:25,896 --> 01:01:29,396
I'm so nervous again.

305
01:01:29,896 --> 01:01:35,396
Yeah, and, um, you know,
I of course didn't really tell you guys...

306
01:01:35,396 --> 01:01:41,396
...specifically what penlight colors to use,
but I knew you guys would get my message...

307
01:01:41,396 --> 01:01:44,396
...cause we share a brain cell, right, right?

308
01:01:46,896 --> 01:01:52,196
And yeah, so, well, um,
now going by the different setlist because we...

309
01:01:52,196 --> 01:01:56,396
...you know, have different setlist
for Day 1 and Day 2, so, uh...

310
01:01:56,396 --> 01:02:01,896
...you know, going by the process of elimination,
we have a couple of songs from my new EP.

311
01:02:01,896 --> 01:02:05,496
Let's actually...
who here bought my EP?

312
01:02:08,396 --> 01:02:13,396
Yay! Thank you so much!
I hope you were lucky to get an autograph.

313
01:02:13,396 --> 01:02:19,096
I tried to sign as much as possible,
but... I knew, you know, sometimes you can't be lucky.

314
01:02:19,096 --> 01:02:24,296
Thank you, thank you!
But yeah, I want you guys to have...

315
01:02:24,296 --> 01:02:29,896
...even more fun than before today.
I mean, you always have fun, so that's good, but, um, yeah!

316
01:02:29,896 --> 01:02:34,896
And, you know, sing along, have fun!
And, I always think that...

317
01:02:34,896 --> 01:02:41,396
...a live stage is where not only me
performing is creating the performance...

318
01:02:41,396 --> 01:02:45,196
...but you guys as well. You really help...

319
01:02:45,196 --> 01:02:49,096
...you know, help everyone
with that special experience, so...

320
01:02:49,096 --> 01:02:53,396
...let's create an unforgettable
memory together today, okay?

321
01:02:55,896 --> 01:02:58,896
Yay! Anyways...

322
01:02:58,896 --> 01:03:03,896
...um, I would also like to shout-out
to those watching at home...

323
01:03:03,896 --> 01:03:09,396
...and at the live viewing in the cinema,
hello, hello to you again! And also...

324
01:03:09,396 --> 01:03:14,196
...the lovely, lovely girls
doing a watch-along right now. Hi, guys!

325
01:03:14,196 --> 01:03:20,896
Thank you, ID, EN, and everyone else
doing the watch-along. Thank you, thank you!

326
01:03:20,896 --> 01:03:26,896
Um, you know, um, I'm always
amazed by everyone's support.

327
01:03:26,896 --> 01:03:31,396
Um, and, and really, without the support of...

328
01:03:31,396 --> 01:03:38,096
...holoEN members as well, like, I wouldn't
have had the confidence to stand here today.

329
01:03:38,096 --> 01:03:41,396
Thank you, I love you!

330
01:03:43,396 --> 01:03:47,396
And of course, I would like to
remind you guys about the hashtag...

331
01:03:47,396 --> 01:03:53,896
...for today's concert as well,
#TakoToriFirstConcert. As usual...

332
01:03:53,896 --> 01:03:58,896
...post your thoughts about it,
post the screenshots, no videos, no videos!

333
01:03:58,896 --> 01:04:04,896
Post the screenshots and, you know, Kiara and I,
whenever we have time, we've been checking...

334
01:04:04,896 --> 01:04:11,396
...the hashtag, and of course after as well,
I want to hear, um, what you guys thought about the live, so yeah!

335
01:04:11,396 --> 01:04:13,896
Thank you, thank you!

336
01:04:13,896 --> 01:04:18,396
And, unlike yesterday...

337
01:04:18,396 --> 01:04:23,396
...first MC means I unfortunately have to...

338
01:04:23,396 --> 01:04:29,396
...bid farewell to those watching
the sneak peek on YouTube. I'm sorry.

339
01:04:29,396 --> 01:04:33,396
But if you want to keep the party going...

340
01:04:33,396 --> 01:04:40,396
...head to the streaming site via the description,
or comment... I don't know where the comment is.

341
01:04:40,396 --> 01:04:42,396
Yeah!

342
01:04:42,396 --> 01:04:49,096
But I know that some of you guys
won't get a chance to see my new outfit...

343
01:04:49,096 --> 01:04:52,896
...that I revealed yesterday. So, I thought...

344
01:04:52,896 --> 01:04:58,896
...maybe I'll do something, um,
maybe you guys can help me transition...

345
01:04:58,896 --> 01:05:02,896
...into the new costume here,
so that even those of you...

346
01:05:02,776 --> 01:05:05,276
And YouTube chiramise can see!
And the YouTube preview can see!

347
01:05:05,276 --> 01:05:07,876
All right, so I'm going to count down from three.

348
01:05:07,876 --> 01:05:10,276
Count down with me, okay?

349
01:05:10,276 --> 01:05:12,776
And then we'll switch into the new outfit for you guys to see.

350
01:05:12,776 --> 01:05:14,276
Ready?

351
01:05:15,276 --> 01:05:17,776
Ready? Give me a "wah" if you're ready!

352
01:05:19,776 --> 01:05:22,176
All right, all right, all right. Here we go!

353
01:05:22,176 --> 01:05:26,276
Three, two, one... hya!

354
01:05:27,976 --> 01:05:30,276
Tada!

355
01:05:30,276 --> 01:05:33,276
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

356
01:05:37,776 --> 01:05:40,476
All right, it's time to move on to the next song.

357
01:05:40,476 --> 01:05:43,776
And I think this song also fits...

358
01:05:43,776 --> 01:05:46,976
...the starry stage perfectly. Not- Not that one yet, but...

359
01:05:46,976 --> 01:05:50,776
But this one is from one of my favorite franchises.

360
01:05:50,776 --> 01:05:54,276
So I hope you guys listen. Anyways,

361
01:05:54,276 --> 01:05:56,676
the song will fit the starry stage perfectly.

362
01:05:56,676 --> 01:05:58,476
Please give it a listen.

363
01:06:03,776 --> 01:06:12,776
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching.

364
01:10:01,452 --> 01:10:11,452
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The free part has ended. Thank you for watching!

